OL,3,GNEWSAMayor wants power to decide on
OL,4,Amajor solar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of South Yorkshire has said
OL,7,Fhe wants more power over major planning
OL,8,Fapplications instead of Whitehall
OL,9,Fdeciding on behalf of local residents.
OL,11,FLabour's Oliver Coppard has been
OL,12,Fanswering questions on BBC Radio
OL,13,FSheffield's phone-in Call Coppard.
OL,15,FHe also spoke about food banks, free
OL,16,Fbus passes, the budget and Sheffield
OL,17,FFC.
OL,19,FRead our takeaways from the hour below
OL,20,For listen to the full interview here.
